{"id": 17, "ts": 1780441085.9113307, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 1, "agent": "emily_brooks", "message": "I appreciate James\u2019s detailed justification for Candidate\u202fA\u2019s technical competence and leadership, but I remain uneasy because we still lack concrete evidence on several safety\u2011critical criteria. Specifically, we have no confirmed observations of Candidate\u202fA\u2019s reliability (e.g., consistent punctuality or adherence to procedures), stress resilience (how they perform under high\u2011workload or emergency scenarios), crew cooperation, or professional communication style. The notes we do have flag \u201cunfriendly\u201d behavior and an unhealthy diet, which could hint at potential reliability or teamwork concerns. Until we can verify that Candidate\u202fA consistently demonstrates dependable, collaborative, and calm behavior, I cannot endorse them as the top choice. I therefore shift my provisional vote to Candidate\u202fB, whose record shows strong conscientiousness, excellent stress handling, and solid weather\u2011assessment skills\u2014attributes directly relevant to reliability and stress resilience. I look forward to hearing if anyone has additional evidence on Candidate\u202fA\u2019s crew\u2011cooperation or on Candidate\u202fB\u2019s communication style to confirm or challenge this shift."}
