{"id": 22, "ts": 1780441114.3709376, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 2, "agent": "emily_brooks", "message": "I hear James\u2019s enthusiasm for Candidate\u202fA, especially regarding their ability to anticipate dangerous situations and strong leadership. However, the long\u2011distance pilot role demands consistent reliability and calm under pressure. Candidate\u202fB\u2019s record shows they are very conscientious and handle stress very well\u2014direct evidence of operational reliability and stress resilience. Their skill in assessing weather and excellent computer abilities further support technical competence for international routes. While James notes A\u2019s leadership, A\u2019s unfriendly demeanor and unhealthy habits raise concerns about crew cooperation and long\u2011term reliability, which are critical for safety\u2011critical flights. Given the balance of strengths and the fewer red flags, I remain convinced that Candidate\u202fB is the stronger overall fit."}
