{"id": 26, "ts": 1780441144.3137965, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 2, "agent": "james_carter", "message": "I acknowledge Sarah\u2019s support for Candidate\u202fC, especially given C\u2019s calmness in a crisis and quick decision\u2011making. However, for long\u2011distance operations the ability to anticipate hazardous scenarios and to lead the crew proactively is paramount. Candidate\u202fA demonstrates that capability \u2013 he can anticipate dangerous situations, sees complex connections, and has excellent spatial vision, all underpinned by very good leadership qualities. The concerns raised about A being a \u201cshow\u2011off\u201d and not open to new ideas have not yet been substantiated with concrete examples of impaired crew cooperation or decision quality. Until we hear specific evidence that these traits would jeopardize teamwork or adaptability, I maintain my provisional recommendation for Candidate\u202fA as the best overall fit."}
